the film of the same name and had combined elements of graphic adventure computer games with some more traditional action adventure gameplay.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0120-2dd949c465b0:d01\", \"start\": 369, \"end\": 456, \"text\": \"A different version of the game was also released for various computer systems in 1988.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0120-2dd949c465b0:d01\", \"start\": 457, \"end\": 501, \"text\": \"The game takes place in Los Angeles in 1947.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0120-2dd949c465b0:d01\", \"start\": 502, \"end\": 602, \"text\": \"The player controls private detective Eddie Valiant, who is always closely followed by Roger Rabbit.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0120-2dd949c465b0:d01\", \"start\": 603, \"end\": 611, \"text\": \"The game\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0120-2dd949c465b0:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0120-2dd949c465b0:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Roger Rabbit\", \"scope\": \"main character\", \"claim\": \"The player controls Roger Rabbit through four levels in the video game Who Framed Roger Rabbit.\", \"answer\": \"Roger Rabbit\", \"quote\": \"The player controls Roger Rabbit through four levels, each with its own specific task to complete.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0120-2dd949c465b0:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0120-2dd949c465b0:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"Eddie Valiant\", \"scope\": \"main character\", \"claim\": \"The player controls private detective Eddie Valiant in the video game Who Framed Roger Rabbit.\", \"answer\": \"Eddie Valiant\", \"quote\": \"The player controls private detective Eddie Valiant, who is always closely followed by Roger Rabbit.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Roger Rabbit\", \"Eddie Valiant\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Roger Rabbit\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"